  "Comparer les exposants": "Compare the exponents",
  "Factoriser": "Factor",
  "ln x = 0 ou x = 2 (x = 0 exclu)": "ln x = 0 or x = 2 (x = 0 excluded)",
  "prendre ln des deux membres, avec le domaine x > 0": "take ln of both sides, with the domain x > 0",
  "sinh, cosh, tanh : définitions et graphes": "sinh, cosh, tanh: definitions and graphs",
  "Définies avec eˣ et e⁻ˣ ; cosh² − sinh² = 1.": "Defined with eˣ and e⁻ˣ; cosh² − sinh² = 1.",
  "sinh x = (eˣ − e⁻ˣ)/2 (impaire), cosh x = (eˣ + e⁻ˣ)/2 (paire, ≥ 1), tanh x = sinh x / cosh x ∈ ]−1 ; 1[.<br>cosh²x − sinh²x = 1.": "sinh x = (eˣ − e⁻ˣ)/2 (odd), cosh x = (eˣ + e⁻ˣ)/2 (even, ≥ 1), tanh x = sinh x / cosh x ∈ ]−1 ; 1[.<br>cosh²x − sinh²x = 1.",
  "Définition": "Definition",
  "e^(ln 2) = 2, e^(−ln 2) = 1/2": "e^(ln 2) = 2, e^(−ln 2) = 1/2",
  "évaluer en ln a : e^(ln a) = a": "evaluate at ln a: e^(ln a) = a",
  "Formules hyperboliques": "Hyperbolic formulas",
  "On les retrouve avec les exponentielles : un + là où la trigo a un −.": "Recover them with exponentials: a + where trigonometry has a −.",
  "sinh(x + y) = sinh x cosh y + cosh x sinh y ; cosh(x + y) = cosh x cosh y + sinh x sinh y (signe +) ; cosh 2x = cosh²x + sinh²x ; 1 − tanh²x = 1/cosh²x.": "sinh(x + y) = sinh x cosh y + cosh x sinh y; cosh(x + y) = cosh x cosh y + sinh x sinh y (+ sign); cosh 2x = cosh²x + sinh²x; 1 − tanh²x = 1/cosh²x.",
  "En fonction de t = tanh x": "In terms of t = tanh x",
